{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n5-907":{"renderings":[{"id":"565743a830b9bd69","role":"label","field":"name","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-907"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Plain past negative"},{"id":"f71da82a34c3906d","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-907"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"The plain past negative: 書かなかった, 食べなかった."},{"id":"433986447b65fed6","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-907"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"The ない-form conjugates like an い-adjective, so its past is なかった. It is the casual equivalent of ませんでした."},{"id":"e778ef23fe34fa83","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-907"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Verb (ない-stem) + なかった."},{"id":"99780d222f41e45f","role":"label","field":"derives","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-907"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"plain past negative (なかった)"}]}}}